/P 206 0 R
/T (Multi-scale modeling, as the name suggests, is a way of linking biological phenomenon of different scales together.  It links the interacting molecular species to the larger picture of how cancer manifest in the body, by linking the logic of the pathway to how the cells behave. We have solved this problem in 2 main stages : )
